    promptContextI18n: { "ja": "組織の指導者たるもの、いかなる場面でも私情を捨て、自ら範を示す覚悟をもつべきだ。", "en": "As the leader of an organization, one should, in any situation, set aside personal feelings and hold the resolve to set an example oneself." },
