    hintI18n: { "ja": "文末の「やらで」が前夜は用事が多くて眠れなかったと述べています。前の空欄にはそれと対になり、いくつもの細々した用事を次々と並べる形を補います。", "en": "The sentence-final 「やらで」 shows there were so many things the night before that you couldn't sleep; the earlier blank needs a matching form that pairs with it and strings several little tasks together." },
